Jer 37:1 , The Egyptians having raised the seige of the Chaldeans, king Zedekiah sends to Jeremiah to pray for the people;
Jer 37:6 , Jeremiah prophesies the Chaldeans' certain return and victory;
Jer 37:11 , He is taken for a fugitive, beaten, and put in prison;
Jer 37:16 , He assures Zedekiah of the captivity;
Jer 37:18 , Intreating for his liberty, he obtains some favour.
